1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,206
Every casino has ONE weakness.

2
00:00:02,556 --> 00:00:03,338
Stay to the END,

3
00:00:03,338 --> 00:00:04,753
and I'll show you what it is.

4
00:00:05,653 --> 00:00:06,242
This is MAX.

5
00:00:06,242 --> 00:00:07,787
Tonight, he's playing ROULETTE.

6
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:09,687
The wheel has 38 POCKETS:

7
00:00:09,687 --> 00:00:12,830
1 to 36, plus 0 and 00.

8
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:15,699
Bet $1 on EVERY number,

9
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:16,887
that's $38.

10
00:00:17,237 --> 00:00:18,283
One number WINS.

11
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:20,500
It pays 35 to 1,

12
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,705
so you get back $36.

13
00:00:22,055 --> 00:00:23,543
The casino keeps $2.

14
00:00:23,543 --> 00:00:24,551
EVERY SPIN.

15
00:00:25,451 --> 00:00:26,475
That's the HOUSE EDGE.

16
00:00:26,825 --> 00:00:27,802
SLOTS, BLACKJACK, CRAPS,

17
00:00:27,802 --> 00:00:30,729
every game has one, built into the PAYOUTS.

18
00:00:31,629 --> 00:00:32,589
And the ROOM helps.

19
00:00:32,939 --> 00:00:34,408
CHIPS don't feel like cash,

20
00:00:34,408 --> 00:00:35,900
free DRINKS keep you seated,

21
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,144
and many casinos hide the CLOCKS.

22
00:00:39,044 --> 00:00:40,324
Anyone can win ONE night.

23
00:00:40,674 --> 00:00:42,234
But over MILLIONS of bets,

24
00:00:42,234 --> 00:00:43,298
the MATH always wins.

25
00:00:44,198 --> 00:00:45,350
So what's the WEAKNESS?

26
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:46,876
TIME.

27
00:00:47,226 --> 00:00:49,231
The edge only works if you KEEP PLAYING.

28
00:00:49,581 --> 00:00:50,992
Max is UP $50,

29
00:00:50,992 --> 00:00:52,397
and he WALKS OUT the door.

30
00:00:52,747 --> 00:00:54,224
The house can't win back money

31
00:00:54,224 --> 00:00:55,734
that already LEFT the building.

